# === UE5 build artifacts ===
Saved/
Intermediate/
DerivedDataCache/
obj/
Build/Receipts/
FileOpenOrder/

# === Visual Studio / IDE auto-generated ===
*.sln
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.filters
*.vcxproj.user
*.suo
*.user
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb

# === Debug symbols (large) ===
*.pdb
*.idb

# === Binaries policy ===
# Decided 2026-05-21: each pair member builds locally; Binaries not shared via depot.
Binaries/

# === Perforce personal config (workspace-bound, never submit) ===
.p4config
p4config.txt
*.p4config

# === Claude Code personal assets ===
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/access.json
.claude/state/
.claude/cache/
.claude/projects/
# MCP server registration (machine-bound absolute paths)
.mcp.json

# === OMC personal assets (all personal; ignore whole tree to cover new subfolders) ===
.omc/

# === Personal editor automation scripts (Python; machine-bound, not shared) ===
Content/Python/

# === Secrets / tokens ===
# Broad patterns (*token*, *api*key*) would silently swallow legit UE5 sources
# (TokenStream*, *ApiKey*); restrict to extensions / explicit filenames instead.
*.env
*.env.local
secrets/
*.token
*.apikey
*.key
*.pem
.discord-token
.anthropic-key

# === IDE personal settings ===
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.vsconfig

# === OS junk ===
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini